#: projects/audiocd/k3baudiotrackwidget.cpp:57
msgid ""
"Preemphasis is mainly used in audio processing.\n"
"Higher frequencies in audio signals usually have lower amplitudes.\n"
"This can lead to bad signal quality on noisy transmission because the high "
"frequencies might become too weak. To avoid this effect, high frequencies are "
"amplified before transmission (preemphasis); the receiver will then weaken them "
"accordingly for playback."
msgstr ""
"Vooraf versterking word hoofsaaklik in oudio verwerking gebruik.\n"
"Hoër frekwensies in oudio seine het gewoonlik laer amplitudes.\n"
"Dit kan veroorsaak dat die sein kwaliteit sleg raak tydens swak versendings. Om "
"hierdie effek tee te werk, word hoë frekwensies voor versending versterk "
"(vooraf versterking). By die ontvanger word dit dan weer verswak voordat dit "
"terug gespeel word."

